@startuml
hide empty description
[*] --> COMMAND_IDLE
COMMAND_IDLE --> COMMAND_BELOW_DIAGNOSTIC_THRESHOLD : active intent, |target| < min diagnostic target
COMMAND_IDLE --> COMMAND_TELEMETRY_UNCERTAIN : command-state / power evidence not trustworthy
COMMAND_IDLE --> COMMAND_PENDING : new evaluable CHARGE/DISCHARGE intent
COMMAND_BELOW_DIAGNOSTIC_THRESHOLD --> COMMAND_PENDING : target becomes evaluable
COMMAND_TELEMETRY_UNCERTAIN --> COMMAND_PENDING : fresh command-state + independent power telemetry
COMMAND_PENDING --> COMMAND_TARGET_TRACKING_EFFECTIVE : direction matches AND tracking within tolerance
COMMAND_PENDING --> COMMAND_PARTIALLY_EFFECTIVE : direction matches, tracking outside tolerance
COMMAND_PARTIALLY_EFFECTIVE --> COMMAND_TARGET_TRACKING_EFFECTIVE : tracking recovers
COMMAND_PENDING --> COMMAND_MISMATCH_CONFIRMED : no direction response until timeout
COMMAND_PARTIALLY_EFFECTIVE --> COMMAND_MISMATCH_CONFIRMED : tracking mismatch persists until timeout
COMMAND_MISMATCH_CONFIRMED --> RESYNC : resend threshold/cooldown + guards permit
RESYNC --> COMMAND_RECOVERY_VERIFYING : full-state resend issued
COMMAND_RECOVERY_VERIFYING --> COMMAND_TARGET_TRACKING_EFFECTIVE : independent physical recovery
COMMAND_TARGET_TRACKING_EFFECTIVE --> RECOVERED : prior mismatch was active
COMMAND_PENDING --> COMMAND_CHARGE_ACCEPTANCE_LIMITED : independently confirmed high-SOC/BMS acceptance limitation
COMMAND_PARTIALLY_EFFECTIVE --> COMMAND_CHARGE_ACCEPTANCE_LIMITED : high-SOC limitation reclassified

state COMMAND_IDLE
state COMMAND_BELOW_DIAGNOSTIC_THRESHOLD
state COMMAND_TELEMETRY_UNCERTAIN
state COMMAND_PENDING
state COMMAND_PARTIALLY_EFFECTIVE
state COMMAND_TARGET_TRACKING_EFFECTIVE
state COMMAND_CHARGE_ACCEPTANCE_LIMITED
state COMMAND_MISMATCH_CONFIRMED
state RESYNC
state COMMAND_RECOVERY_VERIFYING
state RECOVERED

note bottom of COMMAND_PENDING
The watch is intent-based: changing +1200 -> +1350 -> +1290 W
within CHARGE does not hide persistent non-effect by resetting the episode.
end note
note right of COMMAND_BELOW_DIAGNOSTIC_THRESHOLD
Below COMMAND_EFFECT_MIN_TARGET_W is explicitly not evaluable,
not automatically effective.
end note
note right of COMMAND_MISMATCH_CONFIRMED
A full-state resync sends SmartMode, AC mode and both limits.
Late-effect guards may require proven neutrality before an opposite direction.
end note
note bottom of COMMAND_IDLE
NEUTRALIZE has a separate active 0-W watch:
PENDING -> CONFIRMED or NEUTRALIZATION_MISMATCH -> resync.
end note
@enduml
